=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f78b5ab24e1fdd8ec913cf27f080cf2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b83b1cc/uploads/origins/13454068-c186-40e4-95d1-747a96487a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e281d9cd8da3b5d64426d7d8ef08347", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b83b1cc/uploads/origins/13454068-c186-40e4-95d1-747a96487a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e281d9cd8da3b5d64426d7d8ef08347, https://si.imgix.net/2b83b1cc/uploads/origins/13454068-c186-40e4-95d1-747a96487a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff7766cf82c67734207883cbc3838d10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b83b1cc/uploads/origins/13454068-c186-40e4-95d1-747a96487a63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d60889ba73043287f6d48cb53c24293e 3x"}, "body": "Hello!!!\n\nFirstly, I want to say that I am a big fan of your artwork! I am based in the US and I have a hard time buying your art online, but I managed to purchase your acrylic stands of Manhattan and Tachyon from someone who visited Japan. I am including a photo of them in the google drive. They are one of my favorite pieces of merch!\n\nI am also so excited to see that you opened up a skeb! I am so thankful for the opportunity to commission you!\n\nCould you please draw in your style a full body, regular or chibi, picture of my vtuber wearing tachyon's outfit? I would like my vtuber to have Tachyon's earring on her horn and be wearing her outfit and have the same expressions as she would. My vtuber is a pink alligator!\n\nThank you again for this opportunity. I can't wait to see what you create!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NVWhv24X28W4wqsjEExSc8qLQAlJqP7B?usp=drive_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image",